## Enzymatic activities  
Following gel electrophoresis, three bands were identified for Cu/Zn-SOD, two for Mn-SOD and one for Fe-SOD. The Cu/Zn-SOD bands were the most highly expressed in the plants that were treated with ZnSO4 in the sandy loam soil. The bands corresponding to Mn-SOD and Fe-SOD showed lower expression in the plant samples from the clay soil compared to those from the plants that were grown in the sandy loam soil. The CAT activity was not affected by the source of Zn and showed an average activity of 123 mu M H2O2 min-1 mg-1 protein-1 (data not shown).  
